  "title": "Zesty Portuguese Baby Aubergine Stew",
  "description": "A sour and comforting Portuguese dish featuring baby aubergine, this stew is a perfect blend of flavors, with a unique twist of tempering chocolate to balance the sourness, making it a buddhist-temple-friendly meal option.",
