  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the halved baby aubergine and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste, white wine vinegar, grated tempering chocolate, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the stew for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot."
